 $$\frac{(2,-2,1)\cdot (1,1,0)}{(1,1,0) \cdot (1,1,0)}\cdot(1,1,0)$$ 
 $$\frac{0}{2}\cdot(1,1,0)$$ 
 $$(0,0,0)$$ 
 Huh, a null projection... Maybe I can't do it this way after all? 

Answer: This should do the job: 
 n(1)=100; 
n(2)=1000; 
n(3)=10000; 
n(4)=100000000; 
for k=1:4; 
  count = 0;    % reset count to zero for each test 
