{"input_text": "Question: The integral is $I=\displaystyle\int_{-1}^{1}\dfrac{dz}{\sqrt[3]{(1-z)(1+z)^2}}$. I used Mathematica to calculate, the result was $\dfrac{2\pi}{\sqrt{3}}$, I think it may help. 

Answer: $\newcommand{\angles}[1]{\left\langle\, #1 \,\right\rangle}
 \newcommand{\braces}[1]{\left\lbrace\, #1 \,\right\rbrace}
